items.body_excerpt:
Humans are sick:
A desert grows,
Two free batteries will also expand the territory;
Fortunately, you can also eat fish,
For what flows in the river is no longer water;
The sea is roaring and their home is too small;
green or green
It is the last color embellishing the earth.
Blue or blue:
Nuwa can still mend the sky;
It is not the earth that is sick,
It should be human beings who take the medicine ---

